      "id": "reset",
      "name": "Reset",
      "category": "writer",
      "signature": "Reset(Target, Os)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "Writer*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Os",
          "type": "OutputStream&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "!\nThis function reset the writer with a new stream and default settings,\nin order to make a Writer object reusable for output multiple JSONs.\n\\param os New output stream.\n\\code\nWriter<OutputStream> writer(os1);\nwriter.StartObject();\n// ...\nwriter.EndObject();\nwriter.Reset(os2);\nwriter.StartObject();\n// ...\nwriter.EndObject();\n\\endcode"
    },
    {
      "id": "is-complete",
      "name": "IsComplete",
      "category": "writer",
      "signature": "IsComplete(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "Writer*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "!\nA complete JSON has a complete root object or array."
    },
    {
      "id": "get-max-decimal-places",
      "name": "GetMaxDecimalPlaces",
      "category": "writer",
      "signature": "GetMaxDecimalPlaces(Target)",
      "params": [
